  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Health: Africa Regional Malaria: Collating malaria data - Roll back malaria is a component of Strengthening the use of data for malaria decision making in Africa. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;4,406,303. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Malaria control, Health policy and administrative management, Medical research.</narrative>
  </description>
